66
00:05:47,150 --> 00:05:50,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm gonna make sure to do my homework!</font>

67
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:53,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Bah. What a bunch of well-behaved kids...
--Hi! Hi!</font>

68
00:05:53,530 --> 00:05:57,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's with all the
scamperin' around, Senbe-<i>san</i>?</font>

69
00:06:01,430 --> 00:06:05,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's been so long since I've been
on TV that I got little overexcited...!</font>

70
00:06:05,670 --> 00:06:07,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stop acting so lame, will ya?</font>

71
00:06:07,740 --> 00:06:11,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Especially sneakin' your ugly
mug in the background like that!</font>

72
00:06:11,910 --> 00:06:14,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What do you know, you little punk?</font>

73
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:24,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's that?</font>

74
00:06:24,860 --> 00:06:26,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Peace! Peace!</font>

75
00:06:26,290 --> 00:06:29,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I make another appearance later on!</font>

76
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:38,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yay! Yay! Yay! Yay!...</font>

77
00:06:46,010 --> 00:06:48,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's that?</font>

78
00:06:52,350 --> 00:06:54,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh? I wonder what could that be?</font>

79
00:06:57,060 --> 00:06:59,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-This is impossible...!</font>

80
00:06:59,060 --> 00:07:02,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can't believe he caught up to me!</font>

81
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:05,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Nothin' <i>Kinto Un</i> can't handle!</font>

82
00:07:09,940 --> 00:07:11,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here goes!</font>

83
00:07:11,470 --> 00:07:13,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Extend, <i>Nyoibou</i>!</font>

84
