<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, they're back!</font>

86
00:07:25,180 --> 00:07:27,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Things aren't looking good!</font>

87
00:07:27,350 --> 00:07:30,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright, then! I'll momentarily
