88
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:39,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh! You finally give up, huh?!</font>

89
00:07:40,630 --> 00:07:42,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Behind me, are you?</font>

90
00:07:44,540 --> 00:07:46,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Rocket engine on!</font>

91
00:07:56,350 --> 00:07:58,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I did it!</font>

92
00:08:18,440 --> 00:08:20,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's so stupid!</font>

93
00:08:30,070 --> 00:08:31,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">N'cha!</font>

94
00:08:32,780 --> 00:08:34,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Heya!</font>

95
00:08:34,290 --> 00:08:38,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! <i>Kinto Un</i>! Come back!</font>

96
00:08:41,650 --> 00:08:45,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wow! That's so cool!</font>

97
00:08:45,250 --> 00:08:47,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! Wait for me!</font>

98
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:05,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That brat's driving me insane!</font>

99
00:09:05,740 --> 00:09:09,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If I don't put an end to his life soon,
