<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There!</font>

102
00:09:20,610 --> 00:09:25,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I hope the Dragon Balls didn't
break along with the plane...</font>

103
00:09:25,070 --> 00:09:29,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I think I better return to
Red Ribbon HQ for now...</font>

104
00:09:29,310 --> 00:09:31,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That runt's way too strong!</font>

105
00:09:42,020 --> 00:09:43,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Not here!</font>

106
00:09:43,850 --> 00:09:47,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The bag with the Dragon Balls isn't here!</font>

107
00:09:47,660 --> 00:09:51,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come to think of it, I don't
