108
00:09:51,260 --> 00:09:54,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Aha! So he's alive!</font>

109
00:09:54,730 --> 00:09:56,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where the heck did you go?!</font>

110
00:09:56,900 --> 00:09:58,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey!</font>

111
00:10:04,110 --> 00:10:06,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're the ones I just met...</font>

112
00:10:06,010 --> 00:10:08,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Did you run here?!</font>

113
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:13,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Amazing! You must be
as fast as my <i>Kinto Un</i>!</font>

114
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:16,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where did you do your training?</font>

115
00:10:16,050 --> 00:10:19,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's training? Is it strong?</font>

116
00:10:19,190 --> 00:10:21,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Say! What are you playing here?</font>

117
00:10:21,890 --> 00:10:26,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm not playing! I'm looking for a bad guy!</font>

118
00:10:26,030 --> 00:10:27,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A bad guy?</font>

119
00:10:27,630 --> 00:10:29,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kinto Un</i>!</font>

120
00:10:32,030 --> 00:10:34,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! Let me look for the bad guy with you!</font>

121
00:10:34,940 --> 00:10:37,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You'll help me out?</font>

122
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:40,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah! Let me ride on that, too!</font>

123
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:44,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sure... but can you get on it, I wonder?</font>

124
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You guys are good people, huh?</font>

125
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:52,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is so exciting!</font>

126
00:10:52,560 --> 00:10:55,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright! Let's go!</font>

127
00:10:58,730 --> 00:11:00,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Feels great, doesn't it?</font>

128
00:11:06,270 --> 00:11:08,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't fall off, now!</font>

129
00:11:14,010 --> 00:11:15,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's go!</font>

130
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This rural area is just terrible!</font>

131
00:11:20,690 --> 00:11:24,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now I'm stuck! How am I supposed
to get back to Headquarters?</font>

132
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:28,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Perfect!</font>

133
00:11:31,910 --> 00:11:34,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What're you doing?! That's dangerous!</font>

134
00:11:34,670 --> 00:11:36,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Get out of the car.</font>

135
00:11:36,510 --> 00:11:38,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What did you say?!</font>

136
00:11:38,770 --> 00:11:41,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ah, so this is a robbery, is it?</font>

137
00:11:43,270 --> 00:11:45,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see...</font>

138
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:52,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Right in front of a
telephone booth, too... Perfect.</font>

139
00:11:52,010 --> 00:11:54,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're going to regret this!</font>

140
00:11:54,110 --> 00:11:55,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">One second!</font>

141
00:11:57,220 --> 00:12:00,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What on earth...?</font>

142
00:12:04,390 --> 00:12:07,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My true identity is none other than...</font>

143
00:12:09,590 --> 00:12:12,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...the dried plum-eating Suppa Man!
[Suppa = "sour," "super"]</font>

144
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:18,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Surprised?!</font>

145
00:12:18,190 --> 00:12:20,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It would seem this isn't your lucky day!</font>

146
00:12:20,690 --> 00:12:23,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh? How so?</font>

147
00:12:23,300 --> 00:12:28,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?! You must be an outsider
if you have no idea who I am!</font>

148
00:12:28,590 --> 00:12:31,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I thought you looked unfamiliar!</font>

149
00:12:31,620 --> 00:12:35,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Allow me to show you my power!</font>

150
00:12:37,460 --> 00:12:40,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Suppa Man Lightning Punch!</font>

151
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:49,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well?! Are you scared yet?!</font>

152
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:54,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>H-He isn't scared...</i></font>

153
00:12:55,780 --> 00:12:59,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright, then. I'll give you one chance!</font>

154
00:12:59,050 --> 00:13:02,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you're going to run away,
then now's the time to do it!</font>

155
00:13:06,390 --> 00:13:08,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Is he going to run away?</i></font>

156
00:13:08,220 --> 00:13:10,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I sure hope he does...!</i></font>

157
00:13:24,910 --> 00:13:29,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So what can I do for you, Mister?</font>

158
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:33,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you have any airplane capsules
or the like, give them to me.</font>

159
00:13:33,220 --> 00:13:36,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Capsules...? W-What might those be?</font>

160
00:13:36,250 --> 00:13:38,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You've never even heard of capsules?!</font>

161
00:13:38,190 --> 00:13:40,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This really is the middle of nowhere...</font>

162
00:13:40,020 --> 00:13:46,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, well, as you can see,
this is an extremely rural area...!</font>

163
00:13:46,630 --> 00:13:48,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm sorry I can't be of service!</font>

164
00:13:48,860 --> 00:13:52,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Would anyone around here
have an airplane, I wonder?</font>

165
00:13:52,670 --> 00:13:56,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">An airplane, huh?</font>

166
00:13:56,540 --> 00:14:01,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, there is! A guy by the name
of Senbei Norimaki has one, Mister!</font>

167
00:14:01,780 --> 00:14:04,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where is he?</font>

168
00:14:04,110 --> 00:14:06,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's see... You go straight down this road,</font>

169
00:14:06,780 --> 00:14:10,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">and then when you start to see the
ocean, the house on the left is his!</font>

170
00:14:14,390 --> 00:14:17,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm taking your car!</font>

171
00:14:17,330 --> 00:14:21,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please, be my guest! Go right ahead!</font>

172
00:14:24,630 --> 00:14:27,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Take care!</font>

173
00:14:31,570 --> 00:14:35,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I suppose I'll let you go for today...</font>

174
00:14:49,230 --> 00:14:53,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How irritating! Can't this
thing go any faster?!</font>

175
00:15:05,780 --> 00:15:08,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This stupid piece of junk!</font>

176
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:17,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What are you doing?
Watch where you're driving.</font>

177
00:15:18,910 --> 00:15:22,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Excuse me, but could I
see your driver's license?</font>

178
00:15:22,110 --> 00:15:26,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, I'm so sorry. I don't have
my license with me today.</font>

179
00:15:26,950 --> 00:15:30,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright, then! You're taking a
trip with us down to the station!</font>

180
00:15:37,660 --> 00:15:39,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-Why, you...!</font>

181
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:56,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Aren't you a little too old
to be playing with toys?</font>

182
00:16:17,670 --> 00:16:21,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Pretty nice car. I'll be taking it.</font>

183
00:16:21,070 --> 00:16:22,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">P-Please...!</font>

184
00:16:22,640 --> 00:16:25,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Be our guest!</font>

185
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:29,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Take care!</font>

186
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:34,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How weird... Where could he have gone?</font>

187
00:16:34,220 --> 00:16:36,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh! It's Taro-<i>san</i>!</font>

188
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:42,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hiya! What's wrong, Taro-<i>san</i>?</font>

189
00:16:42,470 --> 00:16:44,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-We were beat up!</font>

190
00:16:44,890 --> 00:16:47,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So he still is in this village!</font>

191
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:49,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Which way'd he go?</font>

192
00:16:49,110 --> 00:16:51,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Straight down this road...</font>

193
00:16:51,450 --> 00:16:53,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright, then!</font>

194
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:57,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! Goku-<i>san</i>! Wait!</font>

195
00:17:09,500 --> 00:17:12,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's strange... I don't
see him anywhere at all!</font>

196
00:17:23,150 --> 00:17:24,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That was close!</font>

197
00:17:50,170 --> 00:17:54,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What could that have been?!</font>

198
00:18:30,770 --> 00:18:33,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey!</font>

199
00:18:33,770 --> 00:18:36,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Did you find the bad guy, Goku-<i>kun</i>?</font>

200
00:18:36,310 --> 00:18:40,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, I can't find any trace of him at all!</font>

201
00:18:40,150 --> 00:18:44,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yeah! The Dragon Radar!</font>

202
00:18:44,450 --> 00:18:46,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How come I didn't think of it earlier?</font>

203
00:18:46,950 --> 00:18:50,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He has the Dragon Balls, so I
can look for him with the radar!</font>

204
00:18:50,990 --> 00:18:52,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay!</font>

205
00:18:55,610 --> 00:18:58,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's broken again!</font>

206
00:18:58,530 --> 00:19:03,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll have to take it back
to Bulma so she can fix it...</font>

207
00:19:03,670 --> 00:19:05,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come to think of it, where am I?</font>

208
00:19:05,670 --> 00:19:07,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Penguin Village!</font>

209
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:12,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I was so intent on chasing him,
I'm not sure how I got here...</font>

210
00:19:12,180 --> 00:19:16,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Say, do you know where
the Turtle Hermit lives?</font>

211
00:19:16,180 --> 00:19:17,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No.</font>

212
00:19:17,990 --> 00:19:21,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This isn't good... Where did I wind up?</font>

213
00:19:21,490 --> 00:19:24,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Hey, is that broken?
--Yeah...</font>

214
00:19:24,990 --> 00:19:26,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The doctor can fix it!</font>

215
00:19:26,990 --> 00:19:30,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Really?! Tell me where
that person's house is!</font>

216
00:19:30,160 --> 00:19:31,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sure!</font>

217
00:19:40,170 --> 00:19:44,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We're back!</font>

218
00:19:44,210 --> 00:19:46,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh? What's that?</font>

219
00:19:49,550 --> 00:19:52,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Who might that boy be?</font>

220
00:19:52,550 --> 00:19:55,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It doesn't look like he's
from Penguin Village...</font>

221
00:19:55,360 --> 00:19:58,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's him over there! The doctor!</font>

222
00:19:59,860 --> 00:20:02,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Heya! I mean, hello!</font>

223
00:20:02,560 --> 00:20:06,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Hello there!
--The doctor is this one over here.</font>

224
00:20:06,530 --> 00:20:08,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hi.</font>

225
00:20:10,520 --> 00:20:13,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He says he wants you to fix this!</font>

226
00:20:13,690 --> 00:20:16,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--This?
--Yeah.</font>

227
00:20:16,360 --> 00:20:18,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What is it?</font>

228
00:20:18,760 --> 00:20:20,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A Dragon Radar!</font>

229
00:20:20,730 --> 00:20:23,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dragon Radar...?</font>

230
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:25,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What exactly does it do?</font>

231
00:20:25,370 --> 00:20:29,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It lets you see where the Dragon Balls are!</font>

232
00:20:29,140 --> 00:20:33,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dragon Balls...? I have no idea
what you're talking about...</font>

233
00:20:33,240 --> 00:20:37,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It appears to be a radar designed
to pick up special frequencies...</font>

234
00:20:39,450 --> 00:20:43,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So basically, this thing is
broken and you want it fixed?</font>

235
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:47,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let me take a look at 'er first...</font>

236
00:20:52,510 --> 00:20:54,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What the heck is this?!</font>

237
00:20:54,510 --> 00:20:57,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is made up of insanely
complicated circuits!</font>

238
00:20:57,510 --> 00:21:01,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Exactly what kind of
person made this thing?!</font>

239
00:21:01,050 --> 00:21:03,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A girl called Bulma!</font>

240
00:21:03,950 --> 00:21:08,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A girl?! More brilliant than me...?!</font>

241
00:21:21,310 --> 00:21:23,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey. Do you think you
can fix the Dragon Radar?</font>

242
00:21:23,930 --> 00:21:27,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Of course he can!
Senbei-<i>san</i> is a genius, after all!</font>

243
00:21:27,600 --> 00:21:28,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Right?</font>

244
00:21:33,510 --> 00:21:36,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>It's hopeless. The design is too</i>
<i>complicated, I can't do a thing...</i></font>

245
00:21:36,510 --> 00:21:40,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>W-What do I do?! Aren't I</i>
<i>supposed to be a genius?!</i></font>

246
00:21:40,850 --> 00:21:44,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Dad's in trouble...</i></font>

247
00:21:50,130 --> 00:21:54,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're so great, Dad!
It looks like it's fixed!</font>

248
00:21:54,500 --> 00:21:58,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">R-Really? I barely even touched it...</font>

249
00:22:02,710 --> 00:22:05,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>This house, is it?</i></font>

250
00:22:08,170 --> 00:22:10,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Perfect!</i></font>

251
00:22:10,910 --> 00:22:13,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>There's an airplane sitting there</i>
<i>just when I need one most!</i></font>

252
00:22:13,640 --> 00:22:16,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yay! It's fixed!</font>

253
00:22:23,320 --> 00:22:25,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Not him!</i></font>

254
00:22:25,060 --> 00:22:27,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>This could turn ugly!</i></font>

255
00:22:27,850 --> 00:22:29,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here you are!</font>

256
00:22:31,990 --> 00:22:35,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I-ls it really fixed... ?!</i></font>

257
00:22:39,080 --> 00:22:41,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You did it! It's fixed!</font>

258
00:22:43,630 --> 00:22:46,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">See! I truly am a genius!</font>

259
00:22:46,800 --> 00:22:49,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh?</font>

260
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:50,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's wrong?</font>

261
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:55,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There's a Dragon Ball right around here...</font>

262
00:22:58,280 --> 00:23:00,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So we meet again...</font>

263
00:23:00,450 --> 00:23:03,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dammit...! Let her go!</font>

264
00:23:03,450 --> 00:23:05,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't move!</font>

265
00:23:06,930 --> 00:23:11,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You all stay right there, or she dies!</font>

266
00:23:11,800 --> 00:23:13,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn you...!</font>

267
00:23:15,890 --> 00:23:19,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! Give me back my Dragon Balls!</font>

268
00:23:24,010 --> 00:23:26,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can't move...! Dammit...!</font>

269
00:23:26,820 --> 00:23:30,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">H-Hey! What's wrong?!</font>

270
00:23:30,150 --> 00:23:31,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Are you alright?</font>

271
00:23:31,690 --> 00:23:34,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dad. It's because of his psychic abilities.</font>

272
00:23:34,490 --> 00:23:35,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?</font>

273
00:23:35,990 --> 00:23:38,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Is he a friend of yours?</font>

274
00:23:38,830 --> 00:23:42,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No...! He's a bad guy...!</font>

275
00:23:44,870 --> 00:23:47,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're mine now!</font>

276
00:23:47,170 --> 00:23:52,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It looks like that's a
radar there in your hand...</font>

277
00:23:52,710 --> 00:23:55,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I've collected a lot of presents!</font>

278
00:23:55,550 --> 00:23:57,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Give me that!</font>

279
00:23:57,720 --> 00:24:02,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Y-You jerk...! Give me back my radar...!</font>

280
00:24:02,890 --> 00:24:05,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Um... that belongs to him...</font>

281
00:24:05,720 --> 00:24:10,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you value your lives,
you'll mind your own business.</font>

282
00:24:13,420 --> 00:24:17,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, and I'll be taking this plane, too.</font>

283
00:24:17,410 --> 00:24:19,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dammit...!</font>

284
00:24:23,690 --> 00:24:28,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yes. I nearly forgot
the most important part.</font>

285
00:24:37,940 --> 00:24:40,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You need to die...</font>

286
00:24:44,750 --> 00:24:46,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What are you doing?!</font>

287
00:25:14,290 --> 00:25:16,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What are you doing...?!</font>

288
00:25:16,660 --> 00:25:18,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Making a shish kebab out of you.</font>

289
00:25:18,660 --> 00:25:21,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Darn you...!</font>

290
00:25:24,130 --> 00:25:28,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Arale! Go play a rough game
of pro-wrestling with that guy!</font>

291
00:25:28,270 --> 00:25:31,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay! Yay!</font>

292
00:25:31,140 --> 00:25:33,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Die!</font>

293
00:25:38,840 --> 00:25:41,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Arale Kick!</font>

294
00:25:46,700 --> 00:25:49,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wait for me!</font>

295
00:25:49,240 --> 00:25:51,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wait! Wait for me!</font>

296
00:25:56,380 --> 00:25:58,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I caught up with you!</font>

297
00:25:58,710 --> 00:26:00,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Head-butt!</font>

298
00:26:07,910 --> 00:26:09,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Look at him fly!</font>

299
00:26:19,070 --> 00:26:21,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can move now!</font>

300
00:26:24,030 --> 00:26:26,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--I'm back!
--Welcome back!</font>

301
00:26:27,000 --> 00:26:29,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--That was fun!
--What happened to him?!</font>

302
00:26:29,300 --> 00:26:32,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I beat him up and sent
him flying really far away!</font>

303
00:26:32,700 --> 00:26:35,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You sent him flying really far away?!</font>

304
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:37,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You can't see him anymore...</font>

305
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:40,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Y-You're amazing!</font>

306
00:26:40,210 --> 00:26:43,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But the Ga-<i>chan</i>s are strong, too!</font>

307
00:26:43,230 --> 00:26:44,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Even though you're so tiny!</font>

308
00:26:46,570 --> 00:26:51,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And my friend Obochaman is strong, too!</font>

309
00:26:53,410 --> 00:26:56,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There's tons of guys stronger than me...</font>

310
00:26:56,920 --> 00:26:59,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I need to train even more!</font>

311
00:26:59,500 --> 00:27:04,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yeah! The Dragon Balls!</font>

312
00:27:04,250 --> 00:27:06,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The Dragon Balls...</font>

313
00:27:06,150 --> 00:27:08,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They're here!</font>

314
00:27:08,680 --> 00:27:10,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where's the Dragon Radar...?</font>

315
00:27:10,690 --> 00:27:14,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yeah! He put it in his pocket!</font>

316
00:27:14,360 --> 00:27:17,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I bet he probably survived again...</i></font>

317
00:27:17,530 --> 00:27:20,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I really needed it, too!</i></font>

318
00:27:22,230 --> 00:27:25,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm stuck... There's nothing I can do...</font>

319
00:27:27,570 --> 00:27:32,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I could have Bulma make me another
one, but I don't know the way back.</font>

320
00:27:32,610 --> 00:27:35,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can't look for the balls, either...</font>

321
00:27:36,420 --> 00:27:40,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Shall I make you a new radar?</font>

322
00:27:40,670 --> 00:27:43,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You...? Really?!</font>

323
00:27:43,150 --> 00:27:47,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Can I have some of your airplane parts, Dad?</font>

324
00:27:47,670 --> 00:27:50,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sure, Turbo-<i>kun</i>. But can you
make one out of that stuff?</font>

325
00:27:50,940 --> 00:27:53,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I memorized it when I saw it earlier.</font>

326
00:28:00,450 --> 00:28:03,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You say you memorized it,
but still, how are you...</font>

327
00:28:03,620 --> 00:28:06,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What is that?!</font>

328
00:28:15,170 --> 00:28:16,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here.</font>

329
00:28:24,880 --> 00:28:26,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's exactly the same!</font>

330
00:28:26,980 --> 00:28:29,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Awesome! Thanks!</font>

331
00:28:29,150 --> 00:28:30,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're welcome.</font>

332
00:28:32,020 --> 00:28:35,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Genius certainly runs in the family!</font>

333
00:28:35,590 --> 00:28:37,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay!</font>

334
00:28:37,360 --> 00:28:40,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kinto Un</i>!</font>

335
00:28:43,970 --> 00:28:47,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thanks for everything, you guys!</font>

336
00:28:47,270 --> 00:28:51,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The next time there's a Tenkaichi
Budokai, you should enter it!</font>

337
00:28:59,450 --> 00:29:00,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">See you later!</font>

338
00:29:00,850 --> 00:29:02,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">G'bye!</font>

339
00:29:07,190 --> 00:29:10,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">G'bye!</font>

340
00:29:15,270 --> 00:29:18,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So who exactly was that, anyway?</font>

341
00:29:19,800 --> 00:29:22,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes. Unfortunately, I don't
have the Dragon Balls...</font>

342
00:29:22,870 --> 00:29:26,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But I did acquire the enemy's radar.</font>

343
00:29:26,540 --> 00:29:29,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?! Is that the truth?!</font>

344
00:29:29,610 --> 00:29:31,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes. There is no mistake.</font>

